  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of four to six words. Target I am, it is, or she is. Distractors are other contractions of the same pronoun, such as I'm, I've, and I'll.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of five to seven words. Target do not, is not, or we have. Distractors are nearby n't or have/will forms. Picture lemmas when a pet or object is named.",
    "3": "Near-miss n't pairs. will not maps to won't, not wouldn't or weren't. does not maps to doesn't, not don't. Stems may use <NAME> and two-syllable kid words."
  },
